@startuml sequence-transaction-status
title Статус транзакции (GET /transactions/{transactionId}/status)

actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "individuals-api" as IA
box "transaction-service" #F5F9FF
    participant "TransactionService" as TS
    database "БД (шард по user_uid)" as DB
end box

Client -> IA: GET /api/v1/transactions/{transactionId}/status
alt токен невалиден
    IA --> Client: 401
end
IA -> IA: user_uid из токена
IA -> TS: get status (transactionId, user_uid)
alt transactionId не UUID
    TS --> IA: 400 ErrorResponse
    IA --> Client: 400
end
TS -> DB: SELECT uid, status, failure_reason FROM transactions\nWHERE uid = :transactionId AND user_uid = :userUid
note right of DB
  user_uid в условии: один шард
  и проверка, что транзакция своя
end note
alt не найдена или чужая
    TS --> IA: 404 ErrorResponse
    IA --> Client: 404
end
TS --> IA: 200 TransactionStatusResponse\n(status: PENDING / COMPLETED / FAILED, failure_reason)
IA --> Client: 200 TransactionStatusResponse
note right of Client
  Клиент опрашивает этот endpoint,
  пока PENDING не сменится на итог
end note
@enduml
